  "method": {
    "error_norms": "against sample-point reference data (benchmark tables): unweighted L1 = mean|e|, L2 = sqrt(mean e^2), Linf = max|e| over the tabulated stations; against a field: volume-weighted (cfd/validation/ErrorNorms.hpp)",
